  "sport": "floorball",
  "title": "The carry – down the boards and pass in",
  "description": "One line with balls in a corner by the goal and one line out on the other side level with the centre line. A carries the ball down along the boards. At the same time B runs diagonally forward in towards the slot. A passes to B, who shoots first time.\n\nRotation: A joins the back of line B and B the back of line A. Run it mirrored too. Variant: A does a fake or a turn with the ball before the pass. The diagram is not to scale.",
  "coachingPoints": [
    {
      "id": "cp1",
      "text": "Keep the ball close to the blade and work with it all the way."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp2",
      "text": "Show with your stick where you want the ball."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp3",
      "text": "Pass flat and in front of the runner, without bounce."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp4",
      "text": "Shoot first time and hit the target."
    }
  ],
